# --- NFT generator output (kept local) ----------------------------------------
# 718 MB across 10016 files, mostly artwork (`upload/` duplicates `images/`).
# Nothing at runtime reads it: the frontend resolves artwork from the on-chain
# tokenURI. It is only the offline input to scripts/generate-token-tiers.js,
# whose result IS committed (robinpump-staking/config/token-tiers.csv and
# token-tiers.report.json), so the tier mapping stays reviewable in the repo.
# Consequence: a fresh clone cannot re-run generate-token-tiers.js without
# restoring ROBINPUMP/metadata.raw.csv and ROBINPUMP/traits.json locally.
ROBINPUMP/

# --- Working notes (kept local) -----------------------------------------------
# Original Indonesian brief for the staking extension. Requirements only, no
# code depends on it, so it stays out of the repo at the owner's request.
update .md

